    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.009",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 9,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 172,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 48,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "A conversation is a",
        "moment.",
        "Context is a",
        "practice."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5c0cddb56c9c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.010",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 10,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 398,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 18,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 26.099999999999998,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Why keeping your words is only the",
        "beginning."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dc7ad7690f03",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.011",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 11,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 472,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 15.95,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA · Editorial draft for publication review"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b6b352df7872",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.012",
      "kind": "photograph",
      "paint_order": 12,
      "asset": "coast",
      "x": 24,
      "y": 528,
      "width": 342,
      "height": 235,
      "rotation": -0.6,
      "crop_xywh": [
        0.0,
        50.29,
        1600.0,
        1099.42
      ],
      "position": [
        0.5,
        0.5
      ],
      "arch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 822,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "A useful conversation can still be difficult",
        "to return to. You remember that",
        "something became clearer, but not the",
        "exact wording, the constraint you added",
        "halfway through, or which of several",
        "windows held the decision. The",
        "conversation happened. The continuity",
        "did not arrive automatically."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82640dae68dd",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1085,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "That gap is where we place PAIA. Not in",
        "front of every conversation, asking you to",
        "prepare a perfect brief. Not above your",
        "words, deciding who you are. Beside",
        "them: a working place to find an earlier",
        "expression, see where it came from and",
        "decide whether it still belongs in the next",
        "step."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d71c0c3a88e5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1348,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Keeping everything is not the same as",
        "using something well. A long archive may",
        "contain questions you no longer have,",
        "quotations you never agreed with, and",
        "plans that were deliberately abandoned.",
        "Bringing all of it into a new task can",
        "obscure the very context you were trying",
        "to recover."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-cab99ed91bab",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.016",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1631,
      "x2": 104,
      "y2": 1631,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1673,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 35,
      "font_style": "italic",
      "line_height": 43,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "The useful amount may",
        "be",
        "three sentences, not three",
        "years."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1919,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Selection matters. So does the ability to",
        "revise. You may want the original record",
        "to remain intact while making today’s",
        "working explanation shorter and clearer.",
        "These are compatible needs when the",
        "source and the working version do not",
        "pretend to be the same thing."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9e2ffaaec9e4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2153,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "In this model, context is not a secret",
        "profile that a system accumulates about",
        "you. It is material you can inspect and",
        "deliberately bring to a particular question.",
        "The useful amount may be three",
        "sentences rather than three years. The",
        "relevant version may be the one you",
        "edited this morning."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-3c938990e79a",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2416,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA starts with expressions you already",
        "produce in AI conversations. Its ambition",
        "is continuity without a maintenance habit:",
        "less reconstruction, more room to",
        "continue. Capture, revisit, understand,",
        "reuse. Not a compulsory sequence, but a",
        "set of ways to make past thinking",
        "available when it becomes useful again."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8c7dae4329fb",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2705,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 15.95,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "A product perspective, not a claim of released capability."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-390.022",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2806,
      "x2": 366,
